			"name": "Forge World Origin",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Raised in a Mechanicus-dominated manufactorum world, among servitors and the liturgies of the Cult Mechanicus from birth, whether or not the character ever takes vows to the Priesthood.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, two Basic Set perks/quirks. Disabled by default; GM/player enables it.",
