			"name": "Agri World Origin",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Raised on one of the vast farming worlds that feed the hives — wide horizons, hard physical labour, and a much smaller population than a hive world's.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, two Basic Set perks/quirks. Disabled by default; GM/player enables it.",
