			"name": "Shrine World Origin",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Raised on a world that exists to host a major Imperial shrine or relic — a childhood steeped in pilgrimage traffic and daily liturgy.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, two Basic Set perks/quirks. Disabled by default; GM/player enables it.",
