					"id": "tkjrgzE7vAGYQT-jV",
					"name": "Planetsick",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Open sky and true gravity wells feel wrong after a life spent in the void.\n\nDesign: Quirk (B9), roleplaying flag only.",
					"tags": [
